1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,280
You don't have to crawl behind the stove to clean the pipe.

2
00:00:03,280 --> 00:00:06,280
Soot in the pipe makes the stove draw worse.

3
00:00:06,280 --> 00:00:08,720
This is a chimney sweep kit with flexible rods.

4
00:00:08,720 --> 00:00:12,040
Nine rods, three point six nine meters.

5
00:00:12,040 --> 00:00:13,640
They bend through the curves.

6
00:00:13,640 --> 00:00:14,600
Never stuck.

7
00:00:14,600 --> 00:00:15,520
Insert the brush.

8
00:00:15,520 --> 00:00:16,320
Pull through.

9
00:00:16,320 --> 00:00:17,320
Soot comes off.

10
00:00:17,320 --> 00:00:20,520
Easy to clean it yourself between chimney sweep visits.
